{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-234","published":"2026-10-21T17:47:28Z","modified":"2026-10-21T18:15:04.029092558Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-114536"],"details":"This module provides a suite of Paragraphs bundles that works within the USWDS framework.\n\nThe module's twig templates do not sufficiently sanitize values passed to its markup.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have a role to edit content that uses the paragraph bundles provided by the module.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/uswds_paragraph_components","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/uswds_paragraph_components?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.1.3"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<3.1.3"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<3.1.3","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/uswds_paragraph_components/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-234.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-234"}],"credits":[{"name":"Hemant Gupta (guptahemant)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/guptahemant"]},{"name":"Lee Rowlands (larowlan)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/larowlan"]}]}